ed in the model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}, 'Weight Decay 5e-5': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A specific weight decay regularization parameter used in the model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}, 'Weight Decay 6e-5': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A specific weight decay regularization parameter used in the model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}, 'Accuracy Drop': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['The change in accuracy when comparing the Holistic SparseCNN model to a reference Caffe model.'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}, 'Conv1': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The first convolutional layer in a CNN, such as AlexNet.'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}, 'Conv2': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['The second convolutional layer in a CNN, such as AlexNet.'], 'source_chunk_index': [6]}, 'classification accuracy': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The objective of improving the accuracy of classification tasks.'], 'source_chunk_index': [7]}, 'SGEMM': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ['Highly optimized performance used as a proxy of dense convolution performance.'], 'source_chunk_index': [7]}, 'size': {'type': ['task'], 'description': ['The objective of reducing the size of CNNs.'], 'source_chunk_index': [7]}, 'cross-layer holistic methodology': {'type': ['method'], 'description': ['A methodology that exploits the synergies of sparse methods on convolution layers and fully connected layers.'], 'source_chunk_index': [7]}, 'Convolution Layer Speedup on Server Platform': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ["The speedup factor achieved by the Holistic SparseCNN's convolution layers compared to the best dense convolution on a representative server platform, which is 3.4x."], 'source_chunk_index': [7]}, 'Convolution Layer Speedup on Mobile Platform': {'type': ['generic'], 'description': ["The speedup factor achieved by the Holistic SparseCNN's convolution layers compared to the best dense convolution on a mobile platform, which is 7.3x."], 'source